---
const tags = ['Saxophones, flutes, clarinets', 'Composition and arranging', 'Education', 'Tech'];
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <figure class="about__photo-wrap">
      <img class="about__photo" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/hero.webp`} alt="Doug Rosenberg with saxophone" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <div class="about__body">
      <blockquote class="about__quote">
        &ldquo;Fearlessness of spirit and a robustness of tone that seem likely to win him a devoted following.&rdquo;
        <cite>— Chicago Tribune</cite>
      </blockquote>

      <p class="about__text">
        Doug Rosenberg is a member of the new generation of jazz musicians composing and
        improvising music for the next century. His work on saxophone has an instantly
        recognizable sound and personal melodic language — best known for his work with
        Eastern Blok and Goran Ivanovic, and collaborations with Sam Barsh, Maurice Brown,
        Kelan Phil Cohran, Robert Glasper, Robert &ldquo;Baabe&rdquo; Irving III, Rakalam Bob Moses, and
        Kendrick Scott.
      </p>

      <ul class="dot-list about__tags">
        {tags.map((tag) => (
          <li>{tag}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__photo-wrap {
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
    justify-self: start;
    width: min(100%, 360px);
    /* deliberately offset up, breaking the row's vertical center */
    transform: translateY(-2.5rem);
  }

  .about__photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    filter: grayscale(0.35) sepia(0.18) saturate(1.1);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .about__photo-wrap::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--brass);
    transform: translate(14px, 14px);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  /* The brass frame starts tucked behind the photo and slides out to its
     offset as the photo scrolls into view (2026-10-17). Scroll-driven, no
     script; without support, or under reduced motion, it just sits at the
     offset as before. */
  @keyframes about-frame-slide {
    from {
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
      .about__photo-wrap {
        view-timeline-name: --about-photo;
      }

      .about__photo-wrap::after {
        animation: about-frame-slide linear both;
      }

      /* Separate rule on purpose (see StaffDivider.astro): the minifier
         folds a same-rule timeline into the shorthand. */
      .about .about__photo-wrap::after {
        animation-timeline: --about-photo;
        animation-range: entry 20% cover 45%;
      }
    }
  }

  .about__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.55rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brass);
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .about__quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .about__text {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .about__tags {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about__photo-wrap {
      transform: none;
      width: min(100%, 280px);
    }
  }
</style>
